{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"manual deployment approval manual deployment approval","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md","fileName":"Manual Deployment Approval.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Manual Deployment Approval","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 11:48\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Continuous Delivery Risk and Release Governance]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Continuous Delivery Risk and Release Governance","hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"manual deployment approval manual deployment approval","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md","fileName":"Manual Deployment Approval.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Manual Deployment Approval","heading":"Manual Deployment Approval","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Manual deployment approval requires a named person or group to authorize a release transition. It is appropriate where business timing, regulation, coordinated operations, or evidence interpretation cannot be reduced to an automated condition.\n\nThe approval should record who decided, what artifact was approved, and which evidence was considered. Adding a person who merely clicks through every release increases delay without reducing risk.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Continuous Delivery Risk and Release Governance","hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Deployment Approval.md: